# Process Charter: Knowledge & Event Management

## 1. Process Objective
* **Knowledge Management:** Build an accessible Knowledge Base (KB) to accelerate First Contact Resolution (FCR).
* **Event Management:** Monitor infrastructure health (servers, network latency, links) to detect and resolve issues before business impact occurs.

## 2. Event Thresholds & Actions
| Event Type | Condition / Threshold | Action Taken |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Informational** | Backup completed / User logged in | Logged to system history |
| **Warning** | CPU/Memory Usage > 85% for 10 mins | Automated alert to Infrastructure Team |
| **Exception / Alert** | Primary Internet Link Down | Auto-generate P1/P2 Incident Ticket |
